OL,3,GNEWSAProtest against 'callous' cuts to
OL,4,Aadult social care
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters have gathered outside
OL,7,FOxford's County Hall to oppose #1.8m in
OL,8,Fcuts to the council's adult social care
OL,9,Fbudget.
OL,11,FIt includes charging a #10 daily rate
OL,12,Ffor council-arranged transport, as well
OL,13,Fas invoicing people who use an
OL,14,Findependent living aid #9.87 per week.
OL,15,FDisability-related expenditure
OL,16,Fallowance will also be cut from 35% to
OL,17,F25%.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
