OL,3,GNEWSAProtest against 'callous' cuts to
OL,4,Aadult social care
OL,5,
OL,6,FOxfordshire Disabled People Against
OL,7,FCuts (DPAC) called the decision
OL,8,F"callous" and said the services were
OL,9,Fcrucial "to ensure that disabled people
OL,10,Fcan get to vital care appointments".
OL,12,FThe county council said the decisions
OL,13,Fhad "not been taken lightly" and the
OL,14,Fauthority would contact those affected.
